## How to Use This Textbook

Chapters are designed to be read in order. Each chapter:

- Opens with a story-driven introduction set in South Florida
- Builds concepts through analogies, worked examples, and Mermaid diagrams
- Includes runnable Python code (where applicable) with line-by-line explanation
- Closes with an Ethics in Focus section, vocabulary review, and self-check questions

Companion materials live in sibling folders:

- Hands-on notebooks: [`exercises/`](../exercises/)
- Datasets used in code examples: [`datasets/`](../datasets/)
- Lecture slides: [`slides/`](../slides/)
- Quizzes, discussions, and the final portfolio: [`assessments/`](../assessments/)
